<title>USA: Orion Capital president/COO Hollen resigns.</title>
<headline>Orion Capital president/COO Hollen resigns.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Orion Capital Corp said Thursday that Larry Hollen resigned as president, chief operating officer and board member.</p>
<p>W. Marston Becker, Orion's vice chairman, will assume the duties of chief operating officer, the company said.</p>
<p>Hollen also resigned as vice chairman of Guaranty National Corp, in which Orion holds a more than 80 percent stake.</p>
<p>The specialty property/casualty company said it will present a new director nominee to the Guaranty National board soon but has no plans to fill Hollen's other positions at this time.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
